␀␀␀M␀␀␀4␀␀␀␀␀␀␀:␀␀␀␀␀␀;␀␀␀`␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀␀-␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀␀Z␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀␀␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀+␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿ0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# Type utilities.
